        "text": "Wow, it's echoing through the whole town..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "A pale blue light spills over the desolate streets. In amongst the flickers of illumination, are people and the lives they led."
    },
    {
        "text": "The two stand alone in an otherwise empty town. The hazy song weaves into a web, and the sun continues to set."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
