    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "What is this... what am I seeing? Are these Originium Arts?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "A folk song...? Or a poem? At sunset?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Is this a Wolumonde tradition?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Um... Miss Folinic, do you understand the lyrics?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "No... is that the Leithanian tongue? It doesn't sound like modern Leithanian pronunciation..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "But... it sounds nice."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "It reminds me of looking out over the plains from the bridge of Rhodes Island for the very first time. It's melodious... ancient..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "This is... also Arts... but the same kind as the ancient Arts of Higashi!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
