        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "\u2014An explosion?! Another attack?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_065"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "Schultz! Help! We need help!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Slow down. What happened?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_065"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk",
        "text": "They, they activated those town defense things! They exploded, and everything's burning, they\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Calm down!"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$rungeneral",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Schultz! The Infected... they've captured all of the Gendarmerie patrolling Zw\u00f6lftontechnik Strasse! We lost contact with them!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "They're using the Gramophones to push us back. The whole district is out of control!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "They shouldn't be so well-organized. Who's leading them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "We don't know. But a lot of the non-infected have joined the protest. Wolumonde is completely divided!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Ugh. Damn you, Winterwisps..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Surround the district. Control the crowd. We have to take the town back."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "*Cough* *cough*, *hack* *cough*!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Schultz!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Damn it... You get back to the Rathaus and sound the alarm. This has devolved into something far worse than just a dispute between the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I'm putting Wolumonde under martial law. Raise the entire militia."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "But if we start killing each other now, Wolumonde won't survive the winter!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I gave you an order!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Y-yes sir!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "As for you Rhodes Islanders... Do what you feel is right."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "To be frank, I don't have time to keep an eye on you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
